          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Yusufu nkunkumbatila atatake akuno wakuta na kum'busu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anepo Yusufu nkuvalaija vatumishi vake vaganga, vampake ntela Isilaeli atatake uchinga anakandike, navanang'o nkutenda uchocho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anevo vaganga vátumidile maduva alubaini kukola madengo anelo, kwa kuva njo maduva lachilembelewa. Na Vamisili navanang'o nkunkutangila Yakobo kwa maduva sabini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Palamalilike maduva la kunkutangila, Yusufu nkuvahaulila vashauli vanga Falao kuchidoni, “Ikàva mwenu mùnikatapaliwa na nangu, chonde ngùyuwa mulonjele na Falao kwajili yangu kuva, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "atatangu áningwapisa wachidoni, ‘Nangu ngùvele pepi na kuhwa. Ùlembelewa ukangusike munsati unguvedile kwajili yangu nchilambo cha ku Kanaani.’ Hambi ngùyuwa anguluhusu nguhwene nikansike atatangu, koka nguuye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Falao nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Hwena ukansike atatako malinga chakuapisije.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Yusufu nkuuka, nkuhwena unansika atatake akuno apapatènè na maafisa vohe vanga Falao na vashauli va lukumbi lwanga Falao, pamo na vashauli vammalele va nchilambo cha ku Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uchocho, Yusufu álongene na vanu vammalele va nng'ande mwake na akuluvake vammalele na nnung'une na vanu vammalele va nng'ande mwa Yakobo atatake. Mueneo lya ku Gosheni váisalidile chihi anavao pamo na angandolo na ambudi na ang'ombe vao bahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uchocho, álongene na vakúkwela falasi na mikokoteni iutângwa na falasi, nkuva likuwa likulungwa namene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pavahwikile paluungo lwanga Atadi luvahulila ngano, luvêle mpata wa mashaliki wa muto wa Yoludani, nkulikutangila kwa uchungu namene, na Yusufu nkunnalila atatake matanga kwa uhiku wa maduva saba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vakanaani, yani venedi va chilambo anecho, pavalawene maomboleso latendewîje paluungo luvahulila ngano lwanga Atadi, nkuchidoni, “Maomboleso ala la Vamisili ni makulungwa namene!” Bahi pachinu anepo pavêle ng'ambo yavili ya muto wa Yoludani nkuchemwa Abeli-Misili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Abeli-Misili mana lake “maomboleso la Vamisili.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi vana vanga Yakobo nkuntendela atatawao muchi chavalaijije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Váninnyakula mpaka nchilambo cha ku Kanaani, nkunsika nnipanga livêle mmwelu aneko ku Makipela, pepi na ku Mamle. Lipanga anelyo na welu anewo Iblahimu ánisuma kuhaloka kwanga Efuloni, Mhiti uchinga pààve pachinu pake pakusikila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya kunsika atatake, Yusufu nkuuya ku Misili chalumo na akuluvake na nnung'une na vanu vammalele vanampelekedile unansika atatake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yusufu àvausija akuluvake lipamba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya kuhila atatawao, akuluvake Yusufu nkuhaulanila kuchidoni, “Mbwasa vino Yusufu àmbetuvenga na kutupindikulila mabaya lammalele latuntendeledile.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi vanang'o nkumpelekejija ujumbe uvachidoni, “Atatako kabla akànambikuhwa álaijije uvila, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Nnyaulile Yusufu kwa niaba yangu kuva, ‘Chonde ngùyuwa uvasamehe akuluvako makosa lavo na mabaya lammalele lavakutendeledile.’ Hambi tùyuwa utusamehe mabaya lammalele latukutendeledile hwetu tuvatumishi tùvá Nnungu wa atatako.” Yusufu papilikene ujumbe anewo, nkukuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anepo akuluvake nkumwidilila, nkunhunamila mpaka pahi uvachidoni, “Lola, hwetu ni tuvatumwa vako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henga Yusufu nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Munayope! Dachi, kwani nangu Nnungu mpaka ninnyukumu mwenu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenu múlembela mungutendele mabaya, henga Nnungu ángukudungidile lambone uchinga vanu vohe vapate kuva vomi malinga chimwona nelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi munayope. Nangu nguchinimwing'ange vilyo, mwenu pamo na vana venu.” Bahi Yusufu nkuvatuja mitima na kutangola navo saana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuhwa kwanga Yusufu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yusufu nkuhweneha kuikala nchilambo cha Misili, nang'e pamo na vanu vammalele va nng'ande mwa atatake. Yusufu nkulama kwa uhiku wa vyaka myamoja na kumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yusufu ánijaliwa kuvona vavana na vadukulu va mwanawe Efulaimu. Uchocho, vana vanga Makili mwana wanga Manase, ánivapwechela kuva vana vake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anepo Yusufu nkuvahaulila akuluvake kuchidoni, “Nangu vino ngùvele pepi na kuhwa. Henga muhiu Nnungu achiannyangatange na kummusanga nchilambo achino na kumpelekejanga nchilambo chanamwahidite Iblahimu na Isaka na Yakobo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi Yusufu nkuvaapisa vana vanga Isilaeli wachidoni, “Muhiu Nnungu achiaide unannyangatanga mwenu kuuka nchilambo achino, na mwenu muchimunyakule mawangwa langu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
